summary:
  The helpers hand a saved address to urllib as it stands.

history:
  urllib refuses a space and a letter outside ASCII, which the player spells
  for the wire itself. Measured: for such a station no connection was made
  at all, every day again.

target:
  package/contents/ui/streamkind.py

find:
      req = urllib.request.Request(spelled, headers={"User-Agent": _USER_AGENT})

replace:
      req = urllib.request.Request(url, headers={"User-Agent": _USER_AGENT})

expect:
  Killed by tests/test_loudness.py::test_an_address_with_a_space_a_quote_and_a_token_is_heard
  and tests/test_streamkind.py::test_the_script_reads_an_address_with_a_space_in_it.
  Line-neutral.
